WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.664
A ko: "An ye taga foro dɔ sɛnɛ ɲɔgɔn fɛ, an ye siman taran ɲɔgɔn fɛ.

00:00:05.744 --> 00:00:07.776
" O yɔrɔnin bɛɛ, a sɔnna.

00:00:07.856 --> 00:00:19.011
K'a ta o wagati ra, lilin tun bɛ kasi, ka binw cɛ ka taga ni o ye; lilin fana tun bɛ to ka to ka foro kɔrɔsi, k'a to yirituba jukɔrɔ.

00:00:19.091 --> 00:00:20.447
k'a kunbiri gwan.

00:00:20.527 --> 00:00:28.725
Ayiwa, simantigɛwagati sera minkɛ, o ka bɔgɔdaga dɔ fa, min tun ka ɲi kosɛbɛ, k'a kɛ kilo saba ye.
